title: "presidio-hardened-vol-assign"
abstract: >-
  Multi-objective post-disaster assignment tool: emergency-department volunteer
  staffing (Rabiei et al., ESWA 2023) and humanitarian people-to-centre
  allocation, combining fuzzy inference systems with the NSGA-II and NRGA
  evolutionary algorithms.
